WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.220
For sharing your location on an Android device on WhatsApp, the

2
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:06.500
steps are pretty simple.

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:12.200
First, you must press the paperclip down at the bottom of your screen.

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.680
We'll then open a menu like this, where we select Location.

5
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.500
This will then open the map as you see before you.

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.380
If you're on a site right now, press Send your current location.

7
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.840
If you are not at this site, but you'd like to select that site

8
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:36.580
address, you can press the button in the top left that expands the

9
00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.380
map to full screen.

10
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.200
From there, you'll see a red pin in the centre of your screen, and

11
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.980
you can choose to move that wherever you need.

12
00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.900
Once you have selected where your pin would be, you can press on the

13
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.507
pin and press Send this location.

14
00:00:50.507 --> 00:00:54.480
Quickler will use that pin you have sent to get the weather and your

15
00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.860
address from that location.
